WEBVTT

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.480
We part now for a while.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.650
And this is for you.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.200
They're sour plum supplements.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:14.020
If you take one every day,
your stamina should gradually increase.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:15.930
And what's this?

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:20.680
A custom-ordered go game, powered by the world's most advanced AI.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.760
Shion, you are lacking in challenging rivals.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.840
I encourage you to polish your instincts.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:33.200
Sophie, I wish to see your latent potential come into its own.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:34.930
Come back soon!
Our friend!

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.470
See you later, Hibiki-san!
Come back soon!
Our friend!

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.460
We shall face each other at the tournament in future.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:45.080
If you don't become stronger,
it won't be a worthy competition!

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:50.530
Little Curly!

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.830
Andou, hit it!

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:53.420
Very well.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.660
Bye-bye!

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.340
Capisce!

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:02.030
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.210
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:08.360
Keep winning through the Divine Idol Grand Prix and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.930
All the other idols are amazing, but I won't give up!

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:12.960
Cheer me on, everyone!

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:00.990
Ow-ow-ow – ah!

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:10.790
All right! No one's gonna beat us –
let's keep racking up shows and practice-pri!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.620
Pri! Pri!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:20.840
The Rosette Pact you have dialled is turned off or out of range, so your call cannot be connected!
Pri! Pri!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:20.850
The Rosette Pact you have dialled is turned off or out of range, so your call cannot be connected!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.080
Hm, that's weird.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.010
I can't reach Kuma-san.

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.720
I wonder if something happened...

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:31.530
I just might take this carrot glacé to Usacha-usa...

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.550
Usa!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.920
Help me-usa!

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:37.180
What's going on?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:43.290
This isn't good-ucha. We need to hurry up and form a three-person team-ucha.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:46.690
But pretty much everyone's in a team already.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:47.910
The only ones left...

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.960
Yeah, definitely not her.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:52.490
... ucha.

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.480
Ucha!

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:58.040
Hey, Usacha...

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.250
Huh? Usacha, did you go off somewhere?

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:03.840
You can't find Usagi-san or Usacha-san?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:04.860
Exactly.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.510
She's not answering the Rosette Pact either.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:10.060
Where are you, Meganezaru?

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.350
Arikui-san, where are you?

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:14.840
Namakemono-chan!

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:17.100
Koala? Where'd you go?

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:22.030
This looks pri bad! All the other managers are nowhere to be found either-pri!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.070
I see, I see! This is none other than...

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.470
the Case of the Great Mass Manager Disappearance!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.440
PriPara

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:34.690
We now go live to the Parajuku PriPara, where managers are disappearing one by one.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:34.920
PriPara

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:35.470
Manager Disappearance Incident
BREAKING

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:40.410
<i>I'm on location, where the pandas are busy carrying out a widespread investigation!</i>

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:41.940
Manager Disappearance Incident
BREAKING

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:44.010
<i>What was that sound, I wonder?</i>

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.690
<i>Hm? Say, that's strange.</i>

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:46.350
Manager Disappearance Incident
BREAKING

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:48.640
<i>The pandas have disappeared as well!</i>

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.140
Say, pandas!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.400
<i>Where did you go?</i>

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.840
How frightening! Today is one crazy day!

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:02.190
I'm definitely, definitely not going to PriPara!

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:05.280
What? The pandas disappeared too?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.700
It seems they vanished without a trace-pri.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:08.990
How unusual.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:12.250
Bad news! The goats have disappeared as well!

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.200
The mountain tanuki, too!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.700
Foxes and wolves – animals all and sundry!

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:19.800
What?

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:24.400
So it's not <i>just</i> the managers that are disappearing-pri...

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.530
Indeed. What the vanished creatures have in common is...

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:29.540
that they are beasts!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.320
Mum... Mama?

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.170
Oh, I'm sorry, Jululu.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:37.100
It's about time for your lunch, isn't it?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:41.680
Today Mama cooked you up some vegetable and chicken liver...

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:44.300
Hey, wait, it's gone!

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.340
Who's there?

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.810
What <i>was</i> that... come back here!

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:50.800
Dorothy!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:51.740
Villain!

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:54.690
Jululu, you'll have to make do with milk for now.

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.000
Wait!

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.250
What in the world is happening in PriPara?

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.730
I have to concentrate on forming a team.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.940
What am I supposed to do if I can't find Usacha?

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:10.590
Ow!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.470
What was <i>that</i>?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.930
Ooh-ooh!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:14.840
Wha–

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.310
Wh–Who on earth was that?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.000
Hey, Non!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.500
Did you see which way that person went?

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.140
That way... what are they?

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:30.280
The culprit behind the disappearances, I'm certain!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:30.740
Yeah!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.860
Wait!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:35.490
Wait, they mean that kid?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.580
Wait!

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:42.030
Hey, it's the shoebill.

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:43.960
Did anyone come this way?

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.740
Um... Sophie...

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:53.500
Pushu!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.090
Huh?

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.450
This is from Jululu's lunch!

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:03.950
It's been pri-eaten.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:07.290
In that cave!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:24.110
No! Please don't eat me-ucha!

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:27.000
Onii-cha! Help me-ucha!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.210
Get away from her-usa!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.840
If–If you're going to eat someone, eat me-usa!

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:32.970
U–Usa!

00:07:33.710 --> 00:07:36.300
I–I mean, if you're going to eat someone, eat Kuma-usa!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.850
What are you talking about-kuma?

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.470
Usagi's definitely tastier-kuma! He's a Prench delicacy-kuma!

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:42.910
You're out of your mind-usa!

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.760
Kuma curry would sell like hotcakes in Pokkaido-usa!

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.290
While I'm far from inedible if you simmer me,

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.270
Usagi is better-kuma! He tastes like chicken-kuma!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.990
Oh no! Help me-ucha! Don't eat me-ucha!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:57.950
Stop! You can't eat her!

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.170
It's Lala and the gang-kuma!

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:01.910
They came to rescue us-usa!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:05.790
Hey, you there! You can't eat the mascots!

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.350
And eating them raw?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.770
Huh? She's drooling...

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.260
H–Hey, I'm not food!

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:20.120
You can't eat me, got it? I'm not for eating!

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:23.230
I–I'm not food either!

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.430
N–Neither am I!

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:31.900
Okay-pri? Unlike bears or rabbits, people <i>aren't</i> for eating. Do you com-pri-hend?

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:33.740
Hey, what was that-kuma?

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.320
Man, her drool's <i>gushing</i> out now!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:41.040
Th–That's right! We're not scary – or food!

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.660
Um, I mean...

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:44.200
Capisce!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:56.690
Stay away! I'm a sexy idol, you know!
You can't eat sexy; you'll get a stomachache!

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.550
Dorothy, relax.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:01.450
Reona...

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.440
Ooh!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.930
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.140
What now?

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:19.120
She's dancing around me...

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.200
Ooh-ooh!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.330
Um... er... thank you?

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:26.640
Me Pepper! Come from Sapanna!

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:27.930
"Pepper"...

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:29.490
Wait, she can talk?

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:31.920
Sapanna – we went there earlier!

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.820
Me told you feelings through dance!

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:39.180
Was that meant to be a courtship dance,
like animals do-pri?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.820
Courting Reona?

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:44.020
You kidding me? I'm not handing him over to someone like you!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.320
Be quiet, chihuahua.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:46.640
"Chihuahua"?!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:50.560
Please, Pepper-san. Please give the managers back.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.970
They're our precious friends!

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:54.750
Be quiet, beckoning rabbit.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:55.360
What?

00:09:56.440 --> 00:10:00.890
Me only listen to people stronger than me and Mum.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.300
Your mother?

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:06.500
I'd love to see what kind of nutjob could raise a kid like you.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.190
Then me show you.

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.780
What?! She's a lion?!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:21.740
Why is a lion her mother-pri?

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:24.600
And wait, she's a lion but she has a Rosette Pact?

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.790
Mum... told me...

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:31.900
"You go to country of humans,

00:10:32.430 --> 00:10:35.110
and become queen of the world."

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.920
So me...

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:43.720
leave Sappanna and come here.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.320
"Queen of..."

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.520
"The world..."

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:53.720
It looks like Pepper's mum is trying to tell us something.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:56.040
But I can't speak lionese at all.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:58.420
It'd be convenient if Fuwari were here-pri...

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:01.180
Lions are cats!

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:02.730
Hey, yeah!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:14.600
"Yes, I am indeed Pepper's mother."

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:20.150
Since lions are part of the cat family, Neko-neesan can com-pri-hend her.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:25.440
"My daughter's full name is Taiyou Pepper."

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:27.760
Taiyou as in sun?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.330
That's one heck of a name she has.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:36.630
"There are surely many areas in which she is lacking, but I hope for her to be express herself unashamedly,

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.020
and grow in your care."

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.310
Express herself...

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.090
unashamedly?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.010
Good to eat?

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.260
Uh, well...

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:49.900
"I have faxed my daughter's full profile to you."

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.110
Neko-neesan, a fax came.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:52.650
Here.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.940
It's all pawprints?

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.800
My, she's attended kindergarten-neko.

00:11:59.800 --> 00:12:00.780
Take a look-neko.

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:03.360
Nairopi Distance Education Kindergarten?

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.400
I've never heard of a correspondence course for preschool.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:12.290
Still, if she graduated from kindergarten, I'm sure we can talk with her!

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.330
Right, Pepper-san?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:19.420
So you see, the managers aren't to be eaten. Could you give them back to us, please?

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:20.880
And she's gone!

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:24.370
<i>Take a look, everyone!</i>

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:27.510
<i>At our usually-peaceful fountain square,</i>

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.470
<i>a truly alarming scene is taking place!</i>

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.080
What on earth...

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.580
I really, <i>really</i> don't want to go to PriPara now...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:34.800
Chiri.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:35.340
Eek!

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:37.280
Go to PriPara immediately.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:40.820
At this rate, PriPara will be thrown into chaos.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:43.810
You must stop this imminent disaster with your own power.

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:45.770
There's no way I could do that...

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.340
I couldn't possibly...

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:48.160
Five.

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.440
Four. Three. Two.

00:12:51.440 --> 00:12:54.670
Okay! I'm going right now!

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:04.740
Wh–What should I <i>do</i>?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.200
What should I do?

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.810
Why <i>me</i>?

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:27.250
To all assembled commoners:

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.740
I say good day.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:33.750
My exalted self will put a stop to this bizarre farce disturbing PriPara with characteristic elegance.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:36.830
Hey, you – that's really dangerous; stop it!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:42.210
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:46.200
What should I do?

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.270
Onee-chan's still not here...

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.200
<i>Well</i>.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:53.010
I see you can't do a thing without your precious <i>Onee-chan</i>.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.360
Chiri...

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.640
That's not true at all!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:00.610
Come on! If you don't knock it off, you'll have me to deal with!

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:03.060
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.280
Well, that accomplished nothing.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.910
Allow my noble and high-born self to demonstrate.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.790
Peculiar being, prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:12.090
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!
Peculiar being, prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:14.880
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:18.270
That didn't accomplish anything either!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:19.150
Say that again!

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.970
Right back at you!

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.550
Ucha!

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:30.770
Don't eat Usacha!

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.190
Pepper's eating Non!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.700
Cease and desist!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:42.650
To eat a person without cooking them is simply barbaric!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.760
I may consume fine food every day,

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.830
I myself am not...

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.170
I... I am presently being eaten...

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.800
Oh, how unclean, unclean, unclean!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.640
Full-body cleansing art:

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.780
Chiri-shan-shan!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.810
Tsukikawa

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:15.710
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:17.860
Wh–What is she doing?

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.260
This is a water dance!

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:19.680
Water dance?

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.850
Let the filth be banished!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.250
A performance art handed down from the Edo period, also called a water show.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.570
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:26.060
Filth! Filth! Unconscionable filth!

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:29.530
Chiri must have installed these devices into her
costume as a measure against uncleanliness-pri.

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:32.070
Be cleansed! Be cleansed! Be cleansed!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:35.030
Full-body cleansing art: chiri-shan-shan!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.200
So hot! I'm about to burn up-usa!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.100
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:38.750
The flames are dying down-kuma!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.650
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:41.210
Way to go, Chiri-chan!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.440
Cleansing complete:

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.670
Chiri-shan-shan.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.850
I can't believe Chiri could do something like this!

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:49.760
She amazing.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:54.270
Please, it's nothing so incredible.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.960
Ucha...

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:57.560
Ah!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:01.000
Now, savage – stand down.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.770
Be quiet! Me a lion!

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:08.260
You think I'll retreat from that strange roar?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.570
Back, savage!

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.530
Will you both give it a rest?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.490
It's hardly the time for your arguing!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.250
I–I see it-ucha!

00:16:26.780 --> 00:16:30.800
There it is: a team unlike any other-ucha!

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:31.390
Eh?

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:32.130
Ucha!

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:34.130
Is this yours?

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.140
That's right; Usacha is my manager.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.750
So please give her back–

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:40.310
No, don't eat her!

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.020
Me Pepper.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:45.140
You?

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.440
I'm Non...

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.290
And a licky-stick!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.660
Wh–What?

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:55.880
And you?

00:16:55.880 --> 00:17:00.370
I shan't give my name to one as barbaric as you!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:03.330
Uncivil creature – prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:05.040
Licky-stick!

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:11.540
A–After I went and cleansed myself... I've been defiled with sa–sa–saliva...

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.590
And a licky-stick...

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.970
for all of you too!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.650
<i>Go</i>!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.650
Licky-stick!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.470
Licky-stick!

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:23.560
What in goodness is the fuss over here-glo?

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:29.080
M–Mum!

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.530
Meow, meow!

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:36.920
How poorly-behaved, to be rolling around in the middle of the road!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.160
Then please teach her!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:43.580
This girl was raised by a lion in the Sapanna.
Her name's Pepper-pri!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:46.620
Pepper? Raised by a lion-glo?

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:48.100
Meow, meow!

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:51.870
Here you go – I've finished translating the guide on handling her

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:55.560
which her mother faxed over earlier-neko.

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:56.930
Why, this girl...

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:01.760
She's in direr need of an education than Fuwari-glo!

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.930
"Licky-stick" is her way of greeting...

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.230
Please bear with any distastefulness.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:10.740
So if she's already licky-stuck us...

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:15.620
it means she knows we're not prey, but equals.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.100
"Equals"?

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:21.250
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ooh!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:22.670
In what way are we <i>equals</i>?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:28.010
Do you hear me? I forbid you from ever entering my presence again!

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:31.390
Calm down; don't be like that.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:34.500
After all, we're all friends – we're all idols!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.050
This girl isn't a friend <i>or</i> an idol!

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.840
What idol? Is that tasty?

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.760
An i... an idol...

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:45.210
<i>This</i> is what an idol is!

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:02.410
Scan the appropriate number of tickets for your coord.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.280
Starting the Coord Change.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.060
She's appearing in her super lovely coord,

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:11.460
accentuated by big pink ribbons and gorgeous wings!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.850
Triangle Lovely Coord!

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:14.900
Kano-pero!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.900
Pepper-chan... be still-glo...

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.080
Ju!

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:02.660
Pipi!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:02.730
Kano-pero!

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.400
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:09.840
Zoom!

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:17.270
Hm? Ehe! Swoosh!

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.750
Let's go! Yeah!

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:21.220
Everyone together!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.930
Everyone join hands!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:28.370
Secret wonderful scope!

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:32.990
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:38.430
Ju!

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:38.690
Pipi!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:39.590
Kano-pero!

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.360
Kanon, you're the best!

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:49.050
I'm feeling the Junon juju!

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.640
Take me to Planet Pinon!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.690
So, how did you find your first idol performance-glo?

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.270
Glo...

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.980
I'm so glad they weren't eaten!

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:05.200
I'll have to correct the path of this young lady's education at my academy-glo.

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:11.630
A whole lot of stuff happened today, but I was rescued from being sacrificed,

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:16.040
and more importantly, I received a vision of our new perfect team-ucha!

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:18.320
Really? A new team?

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.540
With whom?

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.400
First is Chiri–

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.460
Why should I have to join a team with that "cleansing water dance" idol?

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.030
I completely refuse, you hear me?

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.000
How uncivil you are.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.510
Prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:32.210
Hmph, that's my sister's thing you're ripping off.

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:35.300
Perhaps, but <i>I</i> am utilising it correctly.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:38.370
Besides, what are you but a pale imitation of her?

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:39.610
Excuse me?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.980
I'm my own idol, and I've made it where I am though perseverance and study!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.560
And without establishing even one believable character, you nonetheless played three?

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:48.600
Impressive indeed.

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:49.880
Oh, you're <i>so</i> annoying!

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:52.120
And so incredibly stuck up!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.580
Um...

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:00.250
You hear me? There's no way,

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.200
no way, no way, no <i>way</i> I'm ever forming a team with...

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:08.520
Uh...

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:10.650
I'm so sorry!

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:13.560
I've been so terribly rude to you, and I'm so sincerely sorry...

00:22:16.820 --> 00:22:19.320
What?

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:54.110
Pepper came to Paprika Academy!

00:23:54.110 --> 00:23:56.830
It looks like Non has her hands full looking after her.

00:23:56.830 --> 00:23:58.660
But heaps of fun things should happen too!

00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:00.690
Don't you think so, Jululu?

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:02.120
Huge news-kuma!

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:03.470
What's wrong, Kuma-san?

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:05.480
Lala, what's Jululu doing-kuma?

00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:06.940
Well, she's just...

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:07.890
<i>not</i> here!

00:24:07.890 --> 00:24:11.760
I suspected as much-kuma!
Something really crazy's going down in PriPara-kuma!

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:13.550
What? What's going on?

00:24:13.550 --> 00:24:16.940
Next time, <i>The Goddess Became an Idol</i>!

00:24:16.940 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
